. capture program drop numpct

. program define numpct
  1.     * Register a share. Value arrives as a proportion and is stored as a p
> ercent.
.     syntax , KEY(string) VALUE(real) [MOE(real -1) SOURCE(string) NOTE(string
> )]
  2.     local p = 100*`value'
  3.     numadd, key(`key') value(`=string(`p',"%18.0g")') ///
>             formatted("`=strtrim(string(`p',"%9.1f"))'%") unit("percent") ///
>             source("`source'") note("`note'")
  4.     if `moe' >= 0 {
  5.         local m = 100*`moe'
  6.         numadd, key(`key'_moe) value(`=string(`m',"%18.0g")') ///
>                 formatted("+/- `=strtrim(string(`m',"%9.1f"))' points") ///
>                 unit("percentage points, 90 percent margin of error") source(
> "`source'") ///
>                 note("90 percent MOE = 1.645 x SDR standard error from the 80
>  PUMS replicate weights. `note'")
  7.     }
  8. end

